{"seq":2,"slug":"virtual-nodes","title":"虚拟节点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/virtual-nodes","wordCount":1512,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"虚拟节点\">虚拟节点</h1><p><a href=\"hash-ring\">哈希环</a> 里留了一个尾巴：裸环上每台机器只占一个点，弧长高低不均，负载方差大到无法接受。虚拟节点（vnode）是几乎所有生产级一致性哈希实现都会打上的补丁——让一台物理机在环上化身成几十到上百个点，用大数定律把方差碾平。Cassandra、DynamoDB 的存储层、Riak 等都依赖这个技巧。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>虚拟节点的想法极简：不再让物理机 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 在环上只占一个点，而是占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 个点，每个点用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>M</mi><mtext>-id</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0.22em\" rspace=\"0.22em\">∥</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">hash(M\\text{-id} \\mathbin{\\|} i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ha</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-id</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\"><span class=\"mord\">∥</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = 0,1,\\dots,v-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8389em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）计算位置。这 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 个点散布在环的各处，物理机 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span> 负责的总弧长，是它所有虚拟节点弧长之和。多个小弧长求和，方差远小于单个大弧长。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>每机虚拟节点数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>负载相对标准差（近似）</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1（裸环）</td>\n<td>很大，最重机器可达均值若干倍</td>\n<td>仅教学示意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>约 ±10% 量级</td>\n<td>DataStax 对 Cassandra 的现代推荐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100–200</td>\n<td>个位数百分比</td>\n<td>追求高均衡的存储/缓存集群</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>下图展示一台物理机如何裂变为多个虚拟节点散布到环上。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[物理机 M] --&gt; B[vnode M#0&lt;br/&gt;hash of M-0]&#10;  A --&gt; C[vnode M#1&lt;br/&gt;hash of M-1]&#10;  A --&gt; D[vnode M#k&lt;br/&gt;hash of M-k]&#10;  B --&gt; E[散布到环上&lt;br/&gt;不同位置]&#10;  C --&gt; E&#10;  D --&gt; E&#10;  E --&gt; F[M 的总负载 =&lt;br/&gt;各 vnode 弧长之和]&#10;  F --&gt; G[弧长求和&lt;br/&gt;方差被摊平]\">flowchart TD\n  A[物理机 M] --&gt; B[vnode M#0&lt;br/&gt;hash of M-0]\n  A --&gt; C[vnode M#1&lt;br/&gt;hash of M-1]\n  A --&gt; D[vnode M#k&lt;br/&gt;hash of M-k]\n  B --&gt; E[散布到环上&lt;br/&gt;不同位置]\n  C --&gt; E\n  D --&gt; E\n  E --&gt; F[M 的总负载 =&lt;br/&gt;各 vnode 弧长之和]\n  F --&gt; G[弧长求和&lt;br/&gt;方差被摊平]</pre><h2 id=\"方差为什么被摊平\">方差为什么被摊平</h2><p>把单台机器的负载看成随机变量。裸环上它等于一个随机弧长，这个弧长服从的分布尾巴很长，少数机器会摊到很长的弧。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 个虚拟节点后，机器负载是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立小弧长之和。由大数定律，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立同分布随机量的均值，其相对波动随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 增大而收缩，标准差大致按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>v</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 的速度下降。</p>\n<p>这给出一条实用的经验法则：要把负载相对标准差压到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>，所需虚拟节点数大致正比于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sigma^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。想从 ±30% 压到 ±10%，约需九倍的虚拟节点。这条平方关系解释了为什么追求极致均衡（如 1% 级）需要上百个虚拟节点，而容忍 10% 量级波动时 8 个就够——这正是 DataStax 在现代 Cassandra 上把默认从 256 调到 8 的依据：8 个 vnode 已能把方差控制在约 10%，同时大幅降低 vnode 过多带来的副作用。</p>\n<h2 id=\"虚拟节点过多的代价\">虚拟节点过多的代价</h2><p>虚拟节点不是越多越好，它有实打实的成本，这也是社区从「几百个」回调到「几个」的原因。</p>\n<p>成本之一是元数据膨胀。环上点数等于机器数乘以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>，每个点都要存点位、所属机器，并参与每次定位的二分查找。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v = 256</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span></span>、机器 100 台，环上就有 25600 个点，有序结构变大、查找常数变高、gossip 传播的环状态变重。</p>\n<p>成本之二是修复与扩容的连锁面变宽。在 Cassandra 这类系统里，一台机器的每个 vnode 都与环上不同邻居发生数据交换关系。vnode 越多，一台机器故障时牵连的对端机器越多，反而可能拖慢修复、扩大故障影响面。这是 DataStax 把推荐值大幅下调的核心理由之一。</p>\n<p>所以选择 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是一个权衡：太小则负载倾斜，太大则元数据膨胀且故障面扩大。把这个权衡的具体数值，结合到真实系统里如何配置，见 <a href=\"../practice/systems-pitfalls\">系统与陷阱</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"加权也藏在虚拟节点里\">加权也藏在虚拟节点里</h2><p>虚拟节点还顺手解决了异构机器的问题：想让一台强机多分担一倍负载，只需给它分配两倍数量的虚拟节点即可。负载比例近似正比于虚拟节点数，这是最简单直接的加权实现。不过这种「靠 vnode 数量加权」的方式粒度粗、且和均衡所需的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 耦合在一起，更系统的加权方法（包括对 Rendezvous 和 Jump 的加权）统一放在 <a href=\"../advanced/weighted-distribution\">加权分布</a> 讲。</p>\n<p>值得一提的是，虚拟节点只压平了「键均匀分布」假设下的结构性倾斜；如果某个具体的键本身就是超热门键（如一个爆款商品 id），它落在哪个 vnode 都会把那台机器压垮。这类热点不是 vnode 能解决的，需要 <a href=\"../advanced/bounded-loads\">有界负载</a> 给负载加硬上限，或在应用层对热点键做拆分。</p>\n<p>虚拟节点数与负载表现、系统成本之间的取舍，可以对照下表权衡，而不是凭感觉取整数。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>每机 vnode 数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>负载平衡增益</th>\n<th>元数据与故障牵连成本</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>无，方差极大</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>仅教学示意</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>约 ±10% 量级</td>\n<td>低，现代 Cassandra 默认</td>\n<td>多数存储/缓存集群</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100–200</td>\n<td>个位数百分比</td>\n<td>中，环状态与 gossip 变重</td>\n<td>追求高均衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数百以上</td>\n<td>收益递减</td>\n<td>高，修复慢、故障面宽</td>\n<td>仅在均衡要求极高时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>围绕虚拟节点，有几个反模式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>以为 vnode 越多越均衡就一路加——超过拐点后均衡收益递减，而故障牵连面持续扩大。</li>\n<li>忽略 vnode 与权重的耦合——想精细加权就狂加 vnode，同时放大了元数据成本。</li>\n<li>指望 vnode 解决单键热点——超热键在任何 vnode 上都会压垮该机器。</li>\n<li>所有集群套用同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span>——应按集群规模与可容忍方差用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>v</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 关系反推。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>虚拟节点让一台物理机在环上占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 个点，把单台机器负载变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 个小弧长之和，标准差按约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msqrt><mi>v</mi></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/\\sqrt{v}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 收缩。</li>\n<li>经验法则：所需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 大致正比于目标相对标准差的平方倒数；8 个 vnode 约对应 ±10%，上百个对应个位数百分比。</li>\n<li>vnode 过多会膨胀元数据、扩大故障牵连面，故现代 Cassandra 推荐值降到 8；选 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">v</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span> 是均衡与成本的权衡，详见 <a href=\"../practice/systems-pitfalls\">系统与陷阱</a>。</li>\n<li>按 vnode 数量加权是最简单的异构支持，系统化加权见 <a href=\"../advanced/weighted-distribution\">加权分布</a>；单键热点需 <a href=\"../advanced/bounded-loads\">有界负载</a> 处理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"虚拟节点","id":"虚拟节点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"方差为什么被摊平","id":"方差为什么被摊平"},{"level":2,"text":"虚拟节点过多的代价","id":"虚拟节点过多的代价"},{"level":2,"text":"加权也藏在虚拟节点里","id":"加权也藏在虚拟节点里"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"哈希环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/hash-ring"},"next":{"title":"Rendezvous 哈希","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/consistent-hashing/techniques/rendezvous-hashing"}}